 7. ☔ Winter forecast: Warmer and wetter 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Image: NOAA Winter in the U.S. looks like it will generally be wetter and warmer, but not necessarily snowier, according to the federal government's seasonal outlook.

 El Niño — the natural but temporary warming in parts of the Pacific — should help erase persistent Western drought but likely won't make Northern snow-lovers happy. Full winter outlook . 

 
 
